.PP
\fBComboChart\fR: bars, lines and areas on \fBone canvas and one scale\fR. Revenue as bars with a target as a line; counts as an area with a moving average over it.
.PP
Layers are painted in the order they are added, so add the backdrop first: an area, then bars, then lines. They share the categories and the value axis, and every series keeps its own color, in the order added.
